  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Media Development Center 2014-2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Media Development Center 2014-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att bidra till utveckling av            medie-sektorn i Palestina genom k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till Media Development       Center (MDC) vid Birzeit University och implementeringen av dess      strategiska plan 2014-2016. Planens strategiska m&#xe5;l inkluderar        kapacitetsut-veckling och organisering av den Palestinska             mediesektorn samt utveckling av MDCs verksamhet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The cooperation&apos;s overall objective is to contribute to the           development of the media sector in Palestine through core support for the Media Development Center (MDC) at Birzeit University and the      implementation of its Strategic Plan 2014-2016. The plan&apos;s strategic  objectives include capacity development and organization of the       Palestinian media sector and the development of MDCs activities</narrative>
  </description>
